            <ArticleTitle>Foreign matter salpingitis 3 years after typhlitis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>253-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This case suggests that typhlitis may cause delayed abdominal pathology. A history of this condition should be considered in the work-up of any patient with gastrointestinal or genitourinary pathology.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
